            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Gustav Mahler's Early Life</strong><br>\nGustav Mahler was born on July 7, 1860, in Bohemia, which was then part of the Austrian Empire. His family was of Jewish descent and had humble origins. From a young age, Mahler showed an extraordinary talent for music. By the time he was six, he was already skilled at the piano and had begun composing. His early experiences with music were largely self-taught until he entered the Vienna Conservatory at the age of 15.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Musical Development</strong><br>\nAt the Vienna Conservatory, Mahler's talents flourished. He studied under renowned teachers and composed music while absorbing the influences of the rich musical culture in Vienna. The city was a hub for the arts and served as a perfect backdrop for Mahler's development as a musician. Here, he was exposed to a wide range of musical styles and historical influences, which later contributed to his distinct compositions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Mahler as a Conductor</strong><br>\nWhile Mahler is known primarily as a composer, he was also one of the leading conductors of his time. His conducting career began in the opera houses of Europe and eventually led him to prestigious posts, such as the director of the Vienna Court Opera. Mahler's approach to conducting was meticulous, and he demanded high standards from the orchestras he led, earning respect and admiration from musicians.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
